<title>NORWAY: Norway's Nov PPI rose 2.8 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Norway's Nov PPI rose 2.8 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES     NOV 1996   OCT 1996  NOV 1995</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	 -0.6	 +0.6	+0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	   +2.8	 +3.7	+1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	    160.5	161.5     156.1</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
